<title>UZBEKISTAN: SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN-YEMEN QUALIFIER POSTPONED.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UZBEKISTAN-YEMEN QUALIFIER POSTPONED.</headline>
<dateline>TASHKENT 1997-07-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A World Cup Asian zone group five qualifier between Uzbekistan and Yemen was postponed on Sunday because the Yemeni team was unable to get to Tashkent to play, an Uzbek soccer official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The match has been cancelled,&quot; a spokesman for the former Soviet republic's football federation said. He said a transport strike in Yemen had prevented the Yemeni team from travelling.</p>
</text>
